    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. I'm particularly interested in the side that emphasizes the positive role of religion. Could you go into more detail on the specific mechanisms by which religious institutions foster social trust and stability? It seems like there's a very strong case to be made that secular alternatives just don't have that same capacity to hold a community together.",
